# The build COPYs only Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, src/, migrations/ and frontend/; everything below
# is kept out of the context so it neither slows the upload nor invalidates the `COPY frontend`
# layer. Patterns are relative to the context root, so `tests` and `docs` leave frontend/tests
# alone. src/ embeds migrations/ at compile time, which is why that one is not listed.
target
data
dist
/node_modules
.e2e-data-*
graphify-out
.superpowers
.claude
docs
tests
.github
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
.git
